      "writtenOn": "2020-08-06T10:25:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ahh, good catch. I added a simple depfile creation to the command using Android.bp.list. Tested it, and incremental regeneration works when I changed an Android.bp file (and no-op when I didn\u0027t).",
